## SqlModal
BeginKeySequence(G): 'g'
CloseModal(SqlModal): Esc, ⇧Esc
ExplainAnalyzeRequest: ⌥'e', ^⌥'e'
ExplainRequest: 'E'
OpenModal(QueryHistoryPicker): 'O'
SqlModalAppendInsert: 'A', ⇧'A'
SqlModalClear: ^'l', ^⌥'l', ^⇧'l'
SqlModalEnterInsert: 'i', ⇧'i'
SqlModalNextTab: Tab
SqlModalPrevTab: BackTab, ⇧BackTab
SqlModalSubmit: ⌥Enter, ^⌥Enter, F(5)
SqlModalYank: 'y', ⇧'y'
TextMoveCursor { target: SqlModal, direction: Down }: 'j', ^'n', Down, ^Down, ⌥Down, ^⌥Down, ⇧Down, ^⇧Down
TextMoveCursor { target: SqlModal, direction: End }: End
TextMoveCursor { target: SqlModal, direction: Home }: Home
TextMoveCursor { target: SqlModal, direction: LastLine }: 'G'
TextMoveCursor { target: SqlModal, direction: Left }: 'h', Left, ^Left, ⌥Left, ^⌥Left, ⇧Left, ^⇧Left
TextMoveCursor { target: SqlModal, direction: LineEnd }: '$'
TextMoveCursor { target: SqlModal, direction: LineStart }: '0'
TextMoveCursor { target: SqlModal, direction: Right }: 'l', Right, ^Right, ⌥Right, ^⌥Right, ⇧Right, ^⇧Right
TextMoveCursor { target: SqlModal, direction: Up }: 'k', ^'p', Up, ^Up, ⌥Up, ^⌥Up, ⇧Up, ^⇧Up
TextMoveCursor { target: SqlModal, direction: ViewportBottom }: 'L'
TextMoveCursor { target: SqlModal, direction: ViewportMiddle }: 'M'
TextMoveCursor { target: SqlModal, direction: ViewportTop }: 'H'
TextMoveCursor { target: SqlModal, direction: WordBackward }: 'b'
TextMoveCursor { target: SqlModal, direction: WordForward }: 'w'
footer: 
help: Alt+Enter / F5: Execute query
help: E: Run EXPLAIN on current query
help: Alt+E: Run EXPLAIN ANALYZE on current query
help: y: Copy query to clipboard
help: i / A: Enter Insert mode / append at line end
help: Tab / Shift+Tab: Switch tab
help: Ctrl+L: Clear editor
help: O: Open Query History
help: h / l / ← / →: Move cursor left / right
help: j / k / ↓ / ↑ / Ctrl+N / Ctrl+P: Move cursor down / up
help: 0 / $ / w / b / Home / End: Move by word or line boundary
help: gg / G / H / M / L: Jump by buffer or viewport
help: Esc: Close editor
palette: see Normal
## ConfirmDialog
ConfirmDialogCancel: Esc
ConfirmDialogConfirm: Enter
Scroll { target: ConfirmDialog, direction: Down, amount: Line }: 'j', ^'n', Down
Scroll { target: ConfirmDialog, direction: Up, amount: Line }: 'k', ^'p', Up
footer: 
help: Enter: Confirm
help: j / k / ↓ / ↑ / Ctrl+N / Ctrl+P: Scroll down / up
help: Esc: Cancel
